  "comment": "Column order of the tables the effect book reads, from poe-tool-dev/dat-schema (PoE2 entries). Offsets are NOT stored - they are arithmetic over the widths in DatColumns. THE JOIN: Projectiles carries its own AOFiles (an array - a projectile may have several art variants), Stuck_AOFile (an array) and Bounce_AOFile; MiscAnimated carries one AOFile; GroundEffects carries an AOFile array and names its type through GroundEffectTypesKey -> GroundEffectTypes.Id. The .ao each names is drawn by the same walk a monster's is. WHAT IS NOT VERIFIED: none of these row sizes has been checked against a running client. Each is checked against the FILE's own row size at runtime - LoadedTable.Agrees - and EffectVisuals.Say reports which way it went. Computed sizes: Projectiles 368, MiscAnimated 44, GroundEffects 235, GroundEffectTypes 64.",
